🎬 Movie Recommendation System
This project builds a content-based movie recommendation system using movie metadata.
The goal is to suggest similar movies based on features such as genre, keywords, cast and description.

📌 Features
Data preprocessing and feature extraction
Text vectorization using TF-IDF
Similarity calculation
Function to generate movie recommendations
Exploratory analysis of movie metadata

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Scikit-learn · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Movie Recommendation.ipynb — complete analysis and recommendation system
